k from morning  until the end of the school day he gets  to take it off for 20 minutes for lunch  and that's it even outdoors during  recess which i know there are people  across the country listening to this  right now and thinking they still wear  masks outdoors but yes my kids have to  wear masks at school outdoors even today  december 2021 and our governor doesn't  you know so she has these these lofty  ideas but she doesn't live by any of  them absolutely uh carol a lot of people  are really struck by your column when a  new york post columnist says i'm leaving  new york and i'm going to still write  uh for the paper and your company  supports you you know how desperate  things are it's uh being a parent first  carol marquis thanks so much  thank you so much all right hi everyone  i'm brian kilmeade i want you to do me a  favor i want you to click to subscribe  to the fox news youtube page this is the  only way that i know for sure that  you're not going to miss any great  commentary any great news bites any  great interviews coming your way on fox  you can get it all here on youtube so  subscribe right now

